{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/news/20261016/photo/bkn-20261016034135680-1016_00822_001_01p.jpg?20261016072857\"/><p>火警發生在元州街一唐樓。(沈厚錚攝)</p><p>深水埗發生火警，現場在元州街68至70號一唐樓，今日（16日）凌晨接近3時，執法部門接報上址後樓梯起火。消防到場開動1條喉及派出1隊煙帽隊，迅即將火救熄。經調查後，相信有雜物起火，並無可疑。事件中，毋須疏散無人受傷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T01:44:54.775810+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":135,"images":1,"source":"東網 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-15T19:41:35+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T03:17:58.589547+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T01:38:51.343709+00:00","content_hash":"57d18e9e977cfdd7de354b1389c9b0367cfc7688e6c22886853427730d92871d","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}